-- Continuity between metric spaces: the ε–δ definition, its equivalence
-- with topological continuity for the metric topologies, composition,
-- Lipschitz maps, and isometries
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
